                      </para>
                    </listitem>
                  </varlistentry>
                  <varlistentry>
                    <term>Automatic + Manual</term>
                    <listitem>
                      <para>
                        DHCP configuration from the network plus static addresses and gateway.
                      </para>
                    </listitem>
                  </varlistentry>
                </variablelist>
              </listitem>
            </varlistentry>
            <varlistentry>
              <term>IPv6 settings</term>
              <listitem>
                <variablelist>
                  <varlistentry>
                    <term>Automatic</term>
                    <listitem>
                      <para>
                        IP address and gateway are assigned from the network with DHCP.
                      </para>
                    </listitem>
                  </varlistentry>
                  <varlistentry>
